# gb10 control: a kernel that does nothing (every thread exits). Same launch shape as the
# vector add. Two uses: (1) the launcher's poison check must report OUTPUT_UNCHANGED,
# (2) its launch-to-done time is the fixed cost of a launch, subtracted in ceiling.md.
0x000000000000794d 0x000fea0003800000  # EXIT
0xfffffffc00fc7947 0x000fc0000383ffff  # BRA self
